00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.259
I'm doing well.

00:00:10.259 --> 00:00:14.059
First thing I want to thank you, because every
day on my drive home from work, I listen to

00:00:14.059 --> 00:00:16.960
you on YouTube and gets me through the.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:17.960
Thank you.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:18.960
