00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.080
I don't mean they're smarter.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.120
They're just doing it.

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:18.540
They're they're carrying it out in a more
effective way.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:22.240
And that includes school boards, PTA, city
